00:15:14.269 --> 00:15:16.901
in those meetings to have the 
autonomy to make decisions

00:15:16.901 --> 00:15:19.673
that make no sense 
on paper but make a

00:15:19.673 --> 00:15:21.509
whole lot of sense on heart.

00:15:21.509 --> 00:15:26.592
We want to build the single 
greatest human organization

00:15:26.592 --> 00:15:28.445
in the history of time.

00:15:28.445 --> 00:15:32.669
(slow trance music)

